
# React Folder Structure: index.html, main.jsx, App.jsx ka relation
 
Flow: index.html → main.jsx → App.jsx → Browser
 
- index.html: Ekmaatra HTML file h ye, Isme sirf <div id="root"> hota hai, which is a khaali
  container jahan React apna UI inject karega. aur, <script src="/src/main.jsx"> se JS load hota hai.
 
- main.jsx: ye h entry point.. document.getElementById('root') se woh khaali wala div uthata hai,
  aur createRoot() se <App /> ko uske andar render karta hai.
 
- App.jsx: ye h Root component, aisa ai ne btaya, Yahan poori app ka main UI likha jaata hai.
  Is se hum chhote components (Profile, Card) import karke use karte hain.
 
Ek line me: index.html khaali div deta hai → main.jsx React ko usme inject krta hai
→ App.jsx ke andar UI hota hai.
